WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.530
A mosquito bite.

2
00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.930
A cough across a crowded room.

3
00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.150
A glass of dirty water.

4
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.890
A shared needle.

5
00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:10.090
Four very different
routes into your body,

6
00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:13.150
and every one of them
can carry disease.

7
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.210
Something tiny is
getting in each time.

8
00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:20.330
So what exactly is it, and is
it the same thing every time?

9
00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:23.830
In this mission, you'll meet
the four types of pathogen:

10
00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:27.220
bacteria, viruses, fungi and protists.

11
00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:30.570
You'll see the different ways
they spread from one person to

12
00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:31.050
the next.

13
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.810
And you'll look at two
killers, H I V and malaria,

14
00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.950
and what causes each.

15
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.130
Your mission: find out what
gets into your body each time.
